.LONG TERM...
Issued at 1145 AM PST Thu Nov 12 2026
(Friday night through next Wednesday)

The storm door remains open through the 7 day forecast period! We
are expecting another system to move through the region Sunday into
Monday and a third system to arrive in the middle of the upcoming
week. These systems are not forecast to stall over any one given
area, thus reducing the potential for widespread flooding concerns.
It is a bit to far out in time to talk about thunderstorm potential
and rainfall amounts, yet current forecast do not seem much greater
than the Friday system (1st system to impact the region). Be sure to
stay informed on the latest forecast information as we the storm
door remains open.

